Handbean iOS distribution license
Copyright (C) 2026 youfun

The Handbean source repository is licensed under the Functional Source
License, Version 1.1, ALv2 Future License (FSL-1.1-ALv2). See the LICENSE
file. That license continues to cover source distributions and builds that
do not statically link iSH.

An iOS binary that statically links iSH (https://github.com/youfun/ish-arm64,
GPLv3) is a combined work. youfun distributes that binary, and offers its
corresponding source, under the GNU General Public License, version 3, as
published by the Free Software Foundation. The license text is LICENSE.GPLv3.
Corresponding source includes the Handbean code linked into that binary, not
only the iSH tree. Recipients of that iOS version receive GPLv3 rights in
that version's source.

Android builds do not use this grant. PRoot remains a separate executable
under GPLv2 and is not linked into the Handbean program.
